<title>PHILIPPINES: Don Pedro 95/96 net up at 247.8 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Don Pedro 95/96 net up at 247.8 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year to August 30.</p>
<p>	    (in million pesos unless stated)</p>
<p>    Turnover (billion)	    1.91 vs 2.12</p>
<p>    Net income		    247.8  vs 122.0</p>
<p>Note: Full name Central Azucarera de Don Pedro. Figures are unaudited.  </p>
<p>The company said the increase in net income, despite lower turnover, was due to its more efficient operations following a modernisation programme.</p>
<p>It said it processed more than 1.2 million tonnes in fiscal 95/96 and its production of raw sugar totalled 2.35 million 50-kilogram bags.</p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom (632) 841-8937</p>
</text>
